Logic :

Find sum of left window which is size of k
Add the right window one by one which if of size length of array - k to length of array and subtract the value of left window simultaneously one by one


Code :
class Solution {
    public int maxScore(int[] cardPoints, int k) {
        int maxans=0;
        for(int i=0;i<k;i++){
            maxans+=cardPoints[i];
        }
        int j=k-1;
        int temp=maxans;
        for(int i=cardPoints.length-1;i>cardPoints.length-1-k;i--){
            temp-=cardPoints[j--];
            temp+=cardPoints[i];
            maxans=Math.max(maxans,temp);
        }
        return maxans;
    }
}
